{"version":"https://jsonfeed.org/version/1.1","title":"补正攻邪 - 标签","description":"这里不仅是我研习中医经典的私人书斋，更是一处致力于 “观照经典以明医理，颐养身心以扶正气” 的清净之地。","home_page_url":"https://lruihao.cn/","language":"zh-CN","icon":"https://lruihao.cn/apple-touch-icon.png","favicon":"https://lruihao.cn/favicon.ico","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://acuherb.xyz/images/avatar.png"}],"items":[{"title":"后治法：论补正攻邪","date_published":"2026-04-27T15:12:52&#43;08:00","date_modified":"2026-04-27T15:13:52&#43;08:00","id":"https://lruihao.cn/posts/2-5-houzhifa/","url":"https://lruihao.cn/posts/2-5-houzhifa/","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://gravatar.loli.net/avatar/89719985bb81a6f9d508808413f1b999?s=32&amp;d=mp"}],"tags":["补正攻邪"],"summary":"本节为《石室秘录》“后治法”部分，论述正气虚而感邪的治疗原则。核心思想是：邪之所凑，其气必虚。当先补其正气，而后方可散邪；不可先攻其邪，以免正气愈伤而邪愈深。","content_html":"本节为《石室秘录》“后治法”部分，论述\u003cstrong\u003e正气虚而感邪\u003c/strong\u003e的治疗原则。核心思想是：\u003cstrong\u003e邪之所凑，其气必虚。当先补其正气，而后方可散邪；不可先攻其邪，以免正气愈伤而邪愈深。\u003c/strong\u003e"}]}